# runtime-switch system (dm/ recompile route). The cheats were designed and statically verified against this
# build in /root/game-transfer/d3_season (cheats_impl_report.md; Route B binary DmIOS.cheats.bin kept as the
# fallback): 46 hooks (39 BL + 7 B trampolines), a dispatcher at the IsSeasonsInitialized cut, and three
# input-poll reloaders, all executing from the patch area tail (guest 0x1ADB800..0x1ADC000, asserted unused by
# the rewriter). The dispatcher reads DM_CHEAT_QOL/LEVEL/DROP/WAR/RES once at startup and on every reloader
# wrap (128 GetNpadStates polls; ~2-4 s), and WRITES the flag either way, so the in-game gear menu toggles
# (settings.tsv rows behind fixups:DM_CHEATS; GameMenu.swift + front_ios.m dm_setting_live) take effect while
# the game runs: menu -> setenv -> reloader wrap -> flags refreshed -> next site hit behaves. Flags live in the
# unused bss pointer slot at 0x1A482C8 (+0 done, +1..+5 groups, +6 the reload counter). High-risk cheats stay
# out of the 46 on purpose. Generated by d3_season/tools/rebuild_build.py; verify with rebuild_verify.py.
